{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46225","headline":"感怀寄卢给事二首 二 · 贯休","name":"感怀寄卢给事二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常忆团圆绣像前，东归经乱独生全。\n孤峯已住六七处，万事无成三十年。\n每想苑墙危逼路，更思鉢塔晓凌烟。\n如今憔悴荆枝尽，一讽来书一怆然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46225.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46225","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}